    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="61e40126-5142-520c-b59e-41f946700f7c" activityNameId="8c2065cd-82e9-5148-90c8-ffb55fda445b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural stone plate, polished, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural stone plate, polished, at regional storage
The polishing is assumed to be done using a polishing machine and very fine grinding medium. No losses are taken into account as no data are available. The dust emissions are estimated based on the losses (0.05 mm abrasion around the granite plate with geometry of 0.5 * 0.5 * 0.03 m and a weight of 2?750 kg/m3).;
UUID: 1ffb4b50-2b15-30c7-b054-794eb9e02ec6
Basis is a ground natural granite plate in a storage. Beside infrastructure some internal transports are included. No administration and wear and spare parts are taken into account. Dust is accounted for.
Location: For some exchanges RER- and GLO-modules are used as proxy
Technology: Typical technology for average Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1ffb4b50-2b15-30c7-b054-794eb9e02ec6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
